ted. The inactive config_scale_value override is normalised out with the 277 viewport. Black uses a #1B1B1D dial with a white hour, translucent #A6FFFFFF with a dark hour, transparent no dial with a white hour; minute and seconds stay constant. Offered only on API 31+; the receiver is disabled below and no degraded no-seconds source is installed. Second-tick fps is system configured and may be disabled; runtime not verified here.&#10;&#10;Previews use the selected style and current permission mode." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[83,1231][997,2082]" /><node index="6" text="Add widget" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" content-desc="Add KWGT Analog Seconds" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[83,2124][997,2260]" /><node index="7" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[83,2281][997,2301]"><node index="0" text="Prev" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" content-desc="Previous widget" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[83,2281][251,2301]" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" content-desc="9 of 11